<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts Bay Apartment.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Salomon cuts Bay Apartment.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it downgraded Bay Apartment Communities Inc to hold from buy based on the stock's recent rise.</p>
<p>-- The stock was off 5/8 at 35-5/8.</p>
</text>
